+---
+id: dl-003-round-long-rental-discounts-down-to-whole-cents
+type: decision-log
+title: "Round long-rental discounts down to whole cents"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Context
+
+Rental totals are represented as integer cents. Applying a 10% discount to a full-price total can
+produce a fractional-cent result.
+
+## Decision
+
+For rentals lasting three days or longer, calculate 90% of the full-price total and round the result
+down to the nearest whole cent.
+
+## Consequences
+
+Quotes and bookings remain integer-cent values. Customers receive at least the advertised 10%
+discount when the mathematical result contains a fractional cent.
